/P 82 0 R
/E (Across development programmes, inefficiencies continue to persist, often driven by fragmented workflows, manual processes, limited financial visibility, and weak audit trails. These gaps not only slow down implementation but also undermine transparency and trust across stakeholders.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (BetterPay addresses these challenges not as a standalone tool, but as core programme infrastructure. It integrates digital registration and attendance verification, automated rule-based payments, real-time budget tracking, and audit-ready reporting into a single, coordinated system that strengthens how programmes are executed and monitored.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
155 0 obj
<<
