/E (AgriScanAI is our flagship agricultural intelligence platform designed to transform how farmers make decisions in an increasingly unpredictable climate and market environment. It enables a shift from reactive farming to predictive, data-driven agriculture. Powered by computer vision, machine learning and localized agricultural intelligence, AgriScanAI delivers context-specific insights based on real farm conditions rather than generic recommendations.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
